        <mxCell id="note1" value="On disaster:&lt;br&gt;1. Run CloudFormation to rebuild infra&lt;br&gt;2. Restore RDS from snapshot&lt;br&gt;3. Update DNS to new endpoints&lt;br&gt;→ Hours to recover" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#ffcccc;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
