        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note3" value="On disaster:&lt;br&gt;1. Scale up DR ASG to full production size&lt;br&gt;2. Promote Aurora reader to writer&lt;br&gt;3. Update Route 53 / Global Accelerator&lt;br&gt;→ Minutes to recover. Full stack already running." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#e8d9ff;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1405" y="450" width="530" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
